        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyarurembo baramusubiza bati “Ni igituro cy'umuntu w'Imana waturutse i Buyuda, ahanurira ku gicaniro cy'i Beteli ibyo ukoze ibyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami aravuga ati “We nimumureke, ntihagire umuntu utaburura amagufwa ye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko amagufwa ye barayareka bareka n'ay'umuhanuzi wavuye i Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi amazu yose y'ingo zo mu midugudu y'i Samariya abami b'Abisirayeli bari barubatse barakaza Uwiteka, Yosiya ayakuraho ayagenza uko yagenje ay'i Beteli kose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yicira abatambyi bose bo mu ngoro zari zihari ku bicaniro byazo abitwikiraho amagufwa y'abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " asubira i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baziririza Pasika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma umwami ategeka abantu bose ati “Nimuziririze Uwiteka Imana yanyu Pasika, nk'uko byanditswe muri cya gitabo cy'isezerano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntabwo baherukaga kuziririza Pasika bihwanye n'ubwo, uhereye igihe abacamanza baciraga Abisirayeli imanza, kugeza ubwo haba no ku ngoma zose z'abami b'Abisirayeli n'iz'ab'Abayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasika iyo yaziririjwe mu mwaka wa cumi n'umunani w'Umwami Yosiya, bayiziririza Uwiteka i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abashitsi n'abapfumu na terafimu n'ibishushanyo bisengwa, n'ibizira byose byabonetse mu Buyuda n'i Yerusalemu, na byo Yosiya abikuraho, kugira ngo asohoze amagambo y'amategeko yanditswe mu gitabo Hilukiya umutambyi yabonye mu nzu y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nta mwami mu bamubanjirije wari uhwanye na we, wahindukiriye Uwiteka n'umutima we wose n'ubugingo bwe bwose n'imbaraga ze zose, akurikije amategeko ya Mose yose, ndetse no mu bamuherutse nta wahwanye na we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko rero Uwiteka ntiyahindukiye ngo areke uburakari bwe bugurumana yarakariye Abayuda, abahoye ibyo Manase yakoreye kumurakaza byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka aravuga ati “Nzakura Abayuda imbere yanjye nk'uko nakuyeho Abisirayeli, kandi nzahakana Yerusalemu iyo, umurwa nitoranirije n'inzu nari naravuzeho nti ‘Ni mo izina ryanjye rizaba.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Ngoma 35.20—36.4\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko indi mirimo ya Yosiya n'ibyo yakoze byose, mbese ntibyanditswe mu gitabo cy'ibyo ku ngoma z'abami b'Abayuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ngoma ya Yosiya, Farawo Neko umwami wa Egiputa arazamuka atera umwami wa Ashuri ku ruzi Ufurate. Umwami Yosiya na we atera Farawo, ariko Farawo amutsinda i Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaragu be bakura intumbi ye i Megido, bayishyira mu igare ry'intambara bamujyana i Yerusalemu, bamuhamba mu mva ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bo mu gihugu bajyana Yowahazi mwene Yosiya, bamwimikisha amavuta bamugira umwami, yima ingoma ya se.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowahazi yimye amaze imyaka makumyabiri n'itatu avutse, amara amezi atatu i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma. Nyina yitwaga Hamutali umukobwa wa Yeremiya w'i Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka nk'ibyo ba sekuruza bakoraga byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Farawo Neko amubohera i Ribula mu gihugu cy'i Hamati, kugira ngo adategeka i Yerusalemu. Abo mu gihugu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abaca icyiru cy'italanto z'ifeza ijana, n'italanto imwe y'izahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.22.11+JER.22.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 22.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maze Farawo Neko yimika Eliyakimu mwene Yosiya asimbura se ku ngoma, ahindura izina rye amuhimba Yehoyakimu. Nuko avanayo Yowahazi, amujyana muri Egiputa agwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehoyakimu aha Farawo izo feza n'izahabu, ariko ategeka abo mu gihugu cy'Abayuda ko ari bo bazitanga nk'uko Farawo yategetse. Yaka umuntu wese wo mu gihugu ifeza n'izahabu uko yazibacaga, ngo abihe Farawo Neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
